<title>FINLAND: Metsa-Serla quoted on Munich bourse.</title>
<headline>Metsa-Serla quoted on Munich bourse.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish forest industry group Metsa-Serla Oy said in a statement on Tuesday its B series share had been listed on the Bayerische Borse in Munich from Monday.</p>
<p>Metsa-Serla B is quoted on the market's so called Freiverkehr-list. The application to start the listing had been made by a German stockbroker, Metsa-Serla said.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 9 - 680 50 245</p>
</text>
